        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"context\":[{\"id\":\"c1\",\"text\":\"We issue debt to take advantage of favorable pricing and liquidity in the debt markets, reflecting our credit rating.\"},{\"id\":\"c2\",\"text\":\"The proceeds of these issuances were or will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include, among other things, funding for working capital, capital expenditures, repurchases of capital stock, acquisitions, and repayment of existing debt.\"},{\"id\":\"c3\",\"text\":\"Refer to Note 9 – Debt of the Notes to Financial Statements (Part I, Item 1 of this Form 10-Q).\"},{\"id\":\"c4\",\"text\":\"Unearned Revenue\"}],\"filing\":\"MSFT 10-Q\",\"section\":\"Part I Item 2\",\"sentences\":[{\"id\":\"s1\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Unearned Revenue\",\"text\":\"Unearned revenue comprises mainly unearned revenue related to volume licensing programs, which may include cloud services and Software Assurance (“SA”).\"},{\"id\":\"s2\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Unearned Revenue\",\"text\":\"Unearned revenue is generally invoiced annually at the beginning of each contract period for multi-year agreements and recognized ratably over the coverage period.\"},{\"id\":\"s3\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Unearned Revenue\",\"text\":\"Unearned revenue also includes payments for other offerings for which we have been paid in advance and earn the revenue when we transfer control of the product or service.\"},{\"id\":\"s4\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Unearned Revenue\",\"text\":\"The following table outlines the expected future recognition of unearned revenue as of March 31, 2026:\"},{\"id\":\"s5\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Unearned Revenue\",\"text\":\"If our customers choose to license cloud-based versions of our products and services rather than licensing transaction-based products and services, the associated revenue will shift from being recognized at the time of the transaction to being recognized over the subscription period or upon consumption, as applicable.\"},{\"id\":\"s6\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Share Repurchases\",\"text\":\"For the nine months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, we repurchased 27 million shares and 23 million shares of our common stock for $13.3 billion and $9.8 billion, respectively, through our share repurchase program.\"},{\"id\":\"s7\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Share Repurchases\",\"text\":\"All repurchases were made using cash resources.\"},{\"id\":\"s8\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Share Repurchases\",\"text\":\"As of March 31, 2026, $44.0 billion remained of our $60 billion share repurchase program.\"},{\"id\":\"s9\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Dividends\",\"text\":\"For the nine months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, our Board of Directors declared dividends totaling $20.3 billion and $18.5 billion, respectively.\"},{\"id\":\"s10\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Dividends\",\"text\":\"We intend to continue returning capital to shareholders in the form of dividends, subject to declaration by our Board of Directors.\"},{\"id\":\"s11\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Other Planned Uses of Capital\",\"text\":\"We will continue to invest in sales, marketing, product support infrastructure, and existing and advanced areas of technology, as well as acquisitions that align with our business strategy.\"},{\"id\":\"s12\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Other Planned Uses of Capital\",\"text\":\"Additions to property and equipment will continue, including new facilities, datacenters, and computer systems for research and development, sales and marketing, support, and administrative staff.\"},{\"id\":\"s13\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Other Planned Uses of Capital\",\"text\":\"We will continue to invest in capital expenditures to support growth in our cloud offerings and our investments in AI infrastructure and training.\"},{\"id\":\"s14\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Other Planned Uses of Capital\",\"text\":\"We have operating and finance leases for datacenters, corporate offices, research and development facilities, and certain equipment.\"},{\"id\":\"s15\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Other Planned Uses of Capital\",\"text\":\"We have not engaged in any related party transactions or arrangements with unconsolidated entities or other persons that are reasonably likely to materially affect liquidity or the availability of capital resources.\"}]}"
